   "code": "/** FMOD_STUDIO_USER_PROPERTY_TYPE */\nenum abstract FmodUserPropertyType(Int) from Int to Int {\n    var INTEGER = 0;\n    var BOOLEAN = 1;\n    var FLOAT = 2;\n    var STRING = 3;\n}",
